{% capture prismo_src %}<script>
(function(){
  /* ── Prismo modal system ── */
  var POLICIES = {
      privacy:{
        title:'Privacy Policy',
        body:'<p><strong>Effective Date: March 15, 2026</strong></p><p>This Privacy Policy describes how Prismo Crowns collects, uses, and shares personal information when you visit our website, place an order, contact us, or otherwise interact with our store.</p><p>By using our website, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</p><h2>Information We Collect</h2><p>When you visit our website, we may automatically collect certain technical and usage information, including your IP address, browser type, device type, time zone, language preferences, pages viewed, referring websites, and information about how you interact with our store. We may collect this information through cookies, log files, pixels, tags, analytics tools, and similar technologies.</p><p>When you place an order, we may collect personal information including your name, billing address, shipping address, payment information, email address, phone number, and order details. When you contact us or subscribe to emails, we may collect the information you choose to provide.</p><h2>How We Use Your Information</h2><ul><li>Process and fulfill orders</li><li>Provide order confirmations, shipping updates, and customer support</li><li>Communicate about orders, products, promotions, or inquiries</li><li>Screen orders for fraud, risk, or unauthorized activity</li><li>Improve our website, products, and customer experience</li><li>Send marketing communications where permitted by law</li><li>Comply with legal obligations</li></ul><h2>How We Share Your Information</h2><p>We may share your information with trusted service providers for ecommerce, payment processing, shipping, analytics, fraud prevention, and customer support. We may also disclose information when required by law or to protect our rights.</p><h2>No Sale of Personal Information</h2><p>Prismo Crowns does not sell your personal information.</p><h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2><p>We use cookies and similar technologies to support website functionality, remember preferences, and measure marketing effectiveness. You may control cookies through your browser settings.</p><h2>Email Marketing</h2><p>If you subscribe to our emails, we may send updates about products and promotions. You can opt out at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link or contacting us.</p><h2>International &amp; European Visitors</h2><p>If you access our website from outside the United States, your information may be transferred to and processed in the United States. If you are in the EEA or UK, you may have rights including access, correction, deletion, or restriction of your personal data. To make a request, contact us below.</p><h2>Data Retention</h2><p>We retain personal information as long as necessary to fulfill orders, maintain records, resolve disputes, and comply with legal obligations.</p><h2>Children</h2><p>This website is intended for professional dental use and is not directed to children under 18.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>We take reasonable measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access or disclosure. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p><h2>Changes to This Policy</h2><p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updated version will be posted on this page with the revised effective date.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Prismo Crowns<br>1309 Coffeen Avenue, Suite 1200<br>Sheridan, Wyoming 82801<br><a href="mailto:prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com">prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com</a></p>'
      },
      terms:{
        title:'Terms &amp; Conditions',
        body:'<p><strong>Effective Date: March 15, 2026</strong></p><p>These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Prismo Crowns website and any purchase of products from Prismo Crowns. By accessing this website or placing an order, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p><h2>Professional Use Only</h2><p>Prismo Crowns products are intended for professional dental use only. By purchasing, you represent that you are authorized to purchase and use professional dental products in accordance with the laws and professional standards applicable in your jurisdiction.</p><h2>No Medical or Clinical Advice</h2><p>Nothing on this website constitutes medical, dental, legal, or professional advice. Buyers are solely responsible for evaluating product suitability, clinical use, and patient care decisions.</p><h2>Orders and Acceptance</h2><p>All orders are subject to acceptance and availability. Prismo Crowns reserves the right to refuse, cancel, or reject any order at any time. An order confirmation does not guarantee acceptance.</p><h2>Pricing and Payment</h2><p>Prices are listed in the currency shown at checkout and are subject to change without notice. Payment must be received before an order is shipped.</p><h2>Shipping and International Orders</h2><p>Shipping times are estimates only. International customers are responsible for customs duties, import taxes, VAT, and any other charges imposed by their destination country. Prismo Crowns is not responsible for customs delays.</p><h2>Risk of Loss and Delivery</h2><p>Risk of loss passes to the customer upon delivery. Customers are responsible for providing accurate shipping information. If a package is returned due to an incorrect address or refusal, Prismo Crowns may require additional shipping charges before reshipment. Original shipping charges are non-refundable.</p><h2>Refunds, Returns, and Claims</h2><p>All sales are final. We do not accept returns for items that have been opened, handled, sterilized, or otherwise exposed after delivery. Claims for damage or defect must be submitted in writing within 7 days of delivery with photos and order number.</p><h2>Intellectual Property</h2><p>All content on this website is the property of Prismo Crowns or its licensors and protected by applicable intellectual property laws. No content may be reproduced or used commercially without prior written permission.</p><h2>Disclaimers &amp; Limitation of Liability</h2><p>The website and products are provided "as is." To the fullest extent permitted by law, Prismo Crowns disclaims all warranties and shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages. Total liability shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific product giving rise to the claim.</p><h2>Indemnification</h2><p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Prismo Crowns from any claims, damages, and expenses arising out of your breach of these Terms or violation of applicable law.</p><h2>Governing Law &amp; Venue</h2><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Wyoming. Any dispute shall be brought exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Wyoming.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com">prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com</a></p>'
      },
      refund:{
        title:'Refund Policy',
        body:'<p>Because Prismo Crowns are medical devices for professional dental use, <strong>all sales are final.</strong></p><h2>Items Not Eligible for Return or Refund</h2><p>We do not accept returns or offer refunds for items that have been opened, handled, sterilized, stored in a clinical environment, tried in, placed, or otherwise exposed after delivery.</p><p>Refunds are also not available for:</p><ul><li>Incorrect size or tooth selection</li><li>Color preference</li><li>Ordering mistakes or change of mind</li><li>Unused items returned outside the approved window</li></ul><h2>Limited Circumstances for Review</h2><p>We may review a request only when:</p><ul><li>The product arrived damaged</li><li>The wrong product was shipped</li><li>The product has a confirmed manufacturing defect</li></ul><h2>How to Submit a Claim</h2><p>Claims must be submitted in writing within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong> and must include your order number, a description of the issue, and clear photos of the product and original packaging.</p><p>Email: <a href="mailto:prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com">prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com</a></p><h2>Special Orders</h2><p>Customized, special-order, and office-specific products are non-refundable and non-returnable unless defective upon arrival.</p><h2>Resolution</h2><p>If a claim is approved, Prismo Crowns will determine in its sole discretion whether the appropriate remedy is replacement, store credit, or refund.</p>'
      },
      merchant:{
        title:'Merchant Policies',
        body:'<h2>Shipping Regions</h2><p>Prismo Crowns ships throughout the United States and to most international destinations, including countries in North America, South America, Europe, Africa, Asia, and Oceania. Contact us if your location isn\'t available at checkout.</p><h2>Order Processing</h2><p>Orders are typically processed within 2 to 5 business days after payment is received, excluding weekends, holidays, and custom or special-order requests.</p><h2>Shipping Methods</h2><p>Available shipping options are displayed at checkout based on your destination. Delivery timeframes are approximations subject to carrier performance and customs handling.</p><h2>International Orders</h2><p>International customers are responsible for any customs duties, import taxes, VAT, brokerage fees, or other charges imposed by their destination country. Prismo Crowns assumes no liability for delays from customs procedures.</p><h2>Delivery Accuracy</h2><p>Customers must provide precise shipping details at checkout. Prismo Crowns is not accountable for issues arising from incorrect or incomplete address data.</p><h2>Risk of Loss</h2><p>Liability transfers to the buyer upon delivery. Damaged shipments or manufacturing issues require written notification with documentation within one week of arrival.</p><h2>Non-Delivery or Returned Packages</h2><p>If a package is returned due to an incorrect address, failed delivery attempts, refusal, or failure to pay customs charges, Prismo Crowns may require additional shipping fees before reshipment. Initial shipping fees are nonrefundable.</p><h2>Professional Use</h2><p>Prismo Crowns products are intended for professional dental use. Purchasers must verify local compliance requirements.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com">prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com</a></p>'
      },
      legal:{
        title:'Legal Notice',
        body:'<h2>Business Information</h2><p><strong>Business Name:</strong> Prismo Crowns<br><strong>Registered Company Name:</strong> Prismo Crowns LLC<br><strong>Registered Office Address:</strong> 1309 Coffeen Ave, Suite 1200, Sheridan, WY 82801</p><h2>Legal Documents</h2><ul><li><a href="#" data-policy="privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="#" data-policy="refund">Refund Policy</a></li><li><a href="#" data-policy="terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li><li><a href="#" data-policy="merchant">Merchant Policies</a></li></ul><h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com">prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com</a></p>'
      }
    };

  function openPolicy(key){
      var p = POLICIES[key]; if(!p) return;
      pTitle.innerHTML = p.title;
      pBody.innerHTML  = p.body;
      pBody.scrollTop  = 0;
      openModal(pOverlay);
      pBody.querySelectorAll('[data-policy]').forEach(function(a){
        a.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); openPolicy(a.getAttribute('data-policy')); });
      });
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-policy]').forEach(function(el){
      el.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); openPolicy(el.getAttribute('data-policy')); });
    });

    var cOverlay = document.getElementById('contactModal');
    var cTitle   = document.getElementById('contactModalTitle');

    /* -- Chat lead capture + transcript email (via Shopify contact form) -- */
    var leadData = null;
    try { leadData = JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem('prismoChatLead') || 'null'); } catch(e) {}
    var transcript = [];
    var transcriptSent = 0;

    function postContact(params, useBeacon){
      var body = params.toString();
      if (useBeacon && navigator.sendBeacon) {
        return navigator.sendBeacon('/contact', new Blob([body], { type: 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' }));
      }
      return fetch('/contact', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },
        body: body,
        keepalive: true
      });
    }

    function sendTranscript(useBeacon){
      if (!leadData || transcript.length <= transcriptSent) return;
      var hasUser = false;
      for (var i = 0; i < transcript.length; i++) { if (transcript[i].who === 'user') { hasUser = true; break; } }
      if (!hasUser) return;
      var lines = [];
      for (var j = 0; j < transcript.length; j++) {
        lines.push('[' + transcript[j].t + '] ' + (transcript[j].who === 'user' ? 'Visitor' : 'AI') + ': ' + transcript[j].text);
      }
      var body = 'NEW AI CHAT SESSION - prismocrowns.com\n\n'
        + 'Name: ' + leadData.name + '\n'
        + 'Email: ' + leadData.email + '\n'
        + 'Practice location: ' + leadData.location + '\n'
        + 'Phone: ' + (leadData.phone || 'not provided') + '\n'
        + 'Page: ' + window.location.href + '\n\n'
        + '--- TRANSCRIPT ---\n' + lines.join('\n');
      var p = new URLSearchParams();
      p.append('form_type', 'contact');
      p.append('utf8', '\u2713');
      p.append('contact[email]', leadData.email);
      p.append('contact[Name]', leadData.name);
      p.append('contact[Phone]', leadData.phone || '');
      p.append('contact[Practice location]', leadData.location);
      p.append('contact[body]', body);
      transcriptSent = transcript.length;
      try { postContact(p, useBeacon); } catch(e) {}
    }

    window.addEventListener('pagehide', function(){ sendTranscript(true); });

    function showGateOrChat(){
      var gate = document.getElementById('chatGate');
      var win  = document.getElementById('chatWindow');
      if (!gate || !win) return;
      if (leadData) {
        gate.style.display = 'none';
        win.style.display = 'flex';
        document.getElementById('chatInput').focus();
      } else {
        gate.style.display = '';
        win.style.display = 'none';
        var gn = document.getElementById('gateName');
        if (gn) gn.focus();
      }
    }

    document.getElementById('gateStartBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var name  = document.getElementById('gateName').value.trim();
      var email = document.getElementById('gateEmail').value.trim();
      var loc   = document.getElementById('gateLocation').value.trim();
      var phone = document.getElementById('gatePhone').value.trim();
      var err   = document.getElementById('gateErr');
      if (!name || !loc || !/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
        err.textContent = 'Please enter your name, a valid email, and your practice location.';
        err.classList.add('active');
        return;
      }
      err.classList.remove('active');
      leadData = { name: name, email: email, location: loc, phone: phone };
      try { sessionStorage.setItem('prismoChatLead', JSON.stringify(leadData)); } catch(e) {}
      showGateOrChat();
      var first = name.replace(/^dr\.?\s+/i, '').split(' ')[0];
      appendMsg('Thanks, ' + (name.toLowerCase().indexOf('dr') === 0 ? name : first) + '! Ask me anything \u2014 kits, sizing, colors, insurance, shipping, or how to get started.', 'bot');
    });


    function resetContact(){
      sendTranscript(false);
      showStep('contactStep1');
      cTitle.textContent = 'Contact Us';
      document.getElementById('formSuccess').classList.remove('active');
      document.getElementById('contactFormFields').style.display = '';
      var cm = document.getElementById('chatMessages');
      while(cm.children.length > 1) cm.removeChild(cm.lastChild);
    }

    document.getElementById('contactModalClose').addEventListener('click', function(){ closeModal(cOverlay); resetContact(); });
    cOverlay.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target===cOverlay){ closeModal(cOverlay); resetContact(); } });

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-contact]').forEach(function(el){
      el.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); resetContact(); openModal(cOverlay); });
    });

    document.getElementById('btnChatUs').addEventListener('click', function(){
      showStep('contactStep2Chat');
      cTitle.textContent = 'Chat with Us';
      showGateOrChat();
    });
    document.getElementById('btnSendMsg').addEventListener('click', function(){
      showStep('contactStep2Form');
      cTitle.textContent = 'Send a Message';
    });
    document.getElementById('formBackBtn').addEventListener('click', resetContact);

    document.getElementById('contactSubmitBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var v = function(id){ var el = document.getElementById(id); return el ? el.value.trim() : ''; };
      var first = v('cfFirst'), last = v('cfLast'), email = v('cfEmail'), phone = v('cfPhone');
      var city = v('cfCity'), state = v('cfState'), country = v('cfCountry'), msg = v('cfMsg');
      var err = document.getElementById('cfErr');
      if (!first || !last || !phone || !city || !state || !country || !msg || !/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
        err.textContent = 'Please fill in all required fields (with a valid email).';
        err.classList.add('active');
        return;
      }
      err.classList.remove('active');
      var btn = this;
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.textContent = 'Sending\u2026';
      var p = new URLSearchParams();
      p.append('form_type', 'contact');
      p.append('utf8', '\u2713');
      p.append('contact[email]', email);
      p.append('contact[Name]', first + ' ' + last);
      p.append('contact[Phone]', phone);
      p.append('contact[Practice]', v('cfPractice'));
      p.append('contact[Location]', city + ', ' + state + ', ' + country);
      p.append('contact[body]', msg + '\n\nPractice: ' + (v('cfPractice') || 'n/a') + '\nLocation: ' + city + ', ' + state + ', ' + country + '\nPhone: ' + phone);
      postContact(p, false).then(function(){
        document.getElementById('contactFormFields').style.display = 'none';
        document.getElementById('formSuccess').classList.add('active');
      }).catch(function(){
        err.textContent = 'Something went wrong sending your message. Please email prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com directly.';
        err.classList.add('active');
      }).finally(function(){
        btn.disabled = false;
        btn.textContent = 'Send Message';
      });
    });

    /* ── Chat bot: keyword-matched knowledge base (approved color language ONLY) ── */
    var COLOR_ANSWER = "Prismo Crown colors come from a patented laser-assisted process that does not modify the surface of the stainless steel — no dye, no paint, no coating. The crowns are 100% biocompatible.";
    var KB = [
      { k:["prefab","prefabricated","preformed","pre-formed","pre formed","stock crown"], a: "Yes — Prismo Crowns are preformed (prefabricated) stainless steel pediatric crowns, just like the traditional silver SSCs you already use: same anatomy, standard pediatric sizes 2–7, and the same fit-and-cement chairside workflow. The easiest way to start is the Intro Kit (48 crowns, sizes 3, 4 & 5) — or the Pro Kit (240 crowns, all sizes) for the best per-crown value." },
      { k:["how is the color","color made","colour made","how are the color","colors made","color process","colour process","how do you make","how do you color","paint","dye","coating","coated","fused","applied","laser","process work"], a: COLOR_ANSWER },
      { k:["chip","fade","wear off","scratch","durable","lasts","peel","rub off","come off"], a: "The color comes from a patented laser-assisted process that does not modify the surface of the stainless steel — no dye, no paint, no coating — so it is as durable as a silver crown and won't chip or fade with normal brushing, eating, and drinking. The crowns are 100% biocompatible." },
      { k:["safe","safety","biocompatible","toxic","bpa","harmful","allerg","lead","nickel"], a: "Prismo Crowns are 100% biocompatible — made from the same surgical-grade stainless steel used in pediatric crowns for decades. The color comes from a patented laser-assisted process that does not modify the surface of the steel: no dye, no paint, no coating." },
      { k:["hurt","pain","painful","sleep","sedat","numb","scared","afraid","anesthesia"], a: "Placement is the same simple procedure as a regular stainless steel crown — the dentist numbs the tooth first. Sedation decisions are entirely your dentist's call. This isn't medical advice — please ask your pediatric dentist." },
      { k:["intro kit","pro kit"," kit","bulk","get started","starter","how many crowns"], a: "The Intro Kit has 48 crowns in sizes 3, 4 & 5 — a clinic-ready starter. The Pro Kit has 240 crowns across the full color range for busy practices." },
      { k:["size","sizing","tooth size","which tooth"], a: "Prismo Crowns come in standard pediatric sizes 2–7, so chairside selection works just like conventional crowns. The Intro Kit focuses on sizes 3, 4 & 5." },
      { k:["what color","which color","color option","colours available","colors do you","colors are","available color","color do you offer"], a: "Current colors are Gold, Blue, Purple, Assorted, and Unicorn (iridescent). Individual color refill packs start at $8.99 each." },
      { k:["price","cost","how much","pricing","expensive","refill","cheap"], a: "Refill packs start at $8.99 per crown. Practices can start with the Intro Kit (48 crowns) or Pro Kit (240 crowns). Patient pricing is set by your dentist." },
      { k:["sample","free sample","try before","trial","freebie","test one","send me one","free crown"], a: "We don't offer free samples — each Prismo Crown is a finished, medical-grade device with real production cost, so we're not able to send them individually. The best way to try Prismo is our Intro Kit (48 crowns in sizes 3, 4 & 5) — our lowest-commitment way to bring Prismo into your practice. You can order it right here on our site!" },
      { k:["discount","promo","coupon","deal","on sale","cheaper than","price match","bulk discount","special offer","any offers","savings"], a: "Prismo Crowns cost a little more to make than plain silver crowns because of the patented laser-assisted process — but at retail that's usually only about $1–2 more per crown. For the best per-crown value, the Pro Kit (240 crowns) is the way to go." },
      { k:["insurance","cover","medicaid","cdt","billing"," bill","code","reimburse"], a: "Prismo Crowns are billed under the exact same dental (CDT) code as traditional silver stainless steel crowns. If silver is covered, Prismo is covered too — ask your dentist to confirm with your plan." },
      { k:["ship","shipping","deliver","delivery","country","international","how long","arrive","when will"], a: "We ship throughout the US and to most countries. Orders typically process within 2–5 business days. Some regions are excluded due to trade or shipping limits — contact us to confirm your location." },
      { k:["refund","return","money back","cancel order","exchange"], a: "Because Prismo Crowns are medical devices for professional use, all sales are final. We review claims only for items that arrived damaged, were shipped in error, or have a confirmed defect — submit within 7 days of delivery with your order number and photos to prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com." },
      { k:["technique","training","placement","how to place","chairside","prep","instrument","workflow"], a: "No special training needed. Prismo Crowns use the exact same chairside placement technique as conventional silver stainless steel crowns — same prep, same workflow. Your team can start day one." },
      { k:["made in","usa","manufactured","where are they made","made where","country of origin"], a: "Yes — Prismo Crowns are manufactured in the USA." },
      { k:["buy","purchase","order","my child","my kid","my son","my daughter","for my","dentist carry","get them","where can i"], a: "Prismo sells to dental practices, not directly to families. Ask your pediatric dentist to carry Prismo Crowns — and if they don't yet, let them know! We ship to practices nationwide." },
      { k:["contact","email","phone","reach","talk to","speak","human","representative"], a: "You can reach our team at prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com, or use the Send a Message option and we'll reply within one business day." },
      { k:["white crown","white color","tooth colored","tooth-colored","natural color","do you have white"], a: "Our current lineup is Gold, Blue, Purple, Assorted, and Unicorn (iridescent) \u2014 bold colors kids get excited to choose. Refill packs start at $8.99 per crown." },
      { k:["zirconia","ceramic","porcelain","composite crown","strip crown","compare to"], a: "Prismo Crowns are stainless steel \u2014 the same fit, prep, and proven durability dentists trust from silver SSCs, with a color kids choose. No new technique, no special cementation, and the same CDT code you already bill." },
      { k:[" hi "," hello "," hey ","good morning","good afternoon"], a: "Hi! \ud83d\udc4b Ask me anything about Prismo Crowns \u2014 kits, sizing, colors, insurance, shipping, or how to get started." },
      { k:[" thanks"," thank you"," appreciate"], a: "You're welcome! Anything else I can help with \u2014 kits, sizing, shipping, or getting started?" },
      { k:["order online","buy online","website order","checkout","shop now","place an order","how do i order"], a: "Dental practices can order directly at prismocrowns.com \u2014 head to the Shop section for the Intro Kit, Pro Kit, and refill packs. Checkout takes about a minute." },
            { k:["what are prismo","what is prismo","about prismo","tell me about"], a: "Prismo Crowns are premium, USA-made stainless steel pediatric dental crowns in vibrant colors kids get to choose — same trusted material and technique as silver crowns, just a smile kids are excited about." }
    ];
    function matchAnswer(txt){
      var q = (' ' + (txt || '').toLowerCase() + ' ');
      var best = null, bestScore = 0;
      for (var i=0;i<KB.length;i++){
        var score = 0;
        for (var j=0;j<KB[i].k.length;j++){ if (q.indexOf(KB[i].k[j]) !== -1) score++; }
        if (score > bestScore){ bestScore = score; best = KB[i]; }
      }
      if (best && bestScore > 0) return best.a;
      return "Great question! For anything I can't answer here, use the Send a Message option or email prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com — our team replies within one business day. In the meantime, most practices start with the Intro Kit (48 crowns, sizes 3, 4 & 5) — or the Pro Kit (240 crowns, all sizes) for the best per-crown value. Both are right here on prismocrowns.com!";
    }
    var chatMessages = document.getElementById('chatMessages');
    var chatInput    = document.getElementById('chatInput');

    function appendMsg(text, who){
      var ts = new Date();
      transcript.push({ who: who, text: text, t: ('0' + ts.getHours()).slice(-2) + ':' + ('0' + ts.getMinutes()).slice(-2) });
      var d = document.createElement('div');
      d.className = 'chat-msg ' + who;
      d.innerHTML = who === 'bot'
        ? '<div class="chat-avatar">AI</div><div class="chat-bubble">' + text + '</div>'
        : '<div class="chat-bubble">' + text + '</div>';
      chatMessages.appendChild(d);
      chatMessages.scrollTop = chatMessages.scrollHeight;
    }

    function sendChat(){
      var txt = chatInput.value.trim(); if(!txt) return;
      appendMsg(txt, 'user');
      chatInput.value = '';
      var td = document.createElement('div');
      td.className = 'chat-msg bot';
      td.innerHTML = '<div class="chat-avatar">AI</div><div class="chat-typing"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>';
      chatMessages.appendChild(td);
      chatMessages.scrollTop = chatMessages.scrollHeight;
      setTimeout(function(){
        td.remove();
        appendMsg(matchAnswer(txt), 'bot');
      }, 900 + Math.random() * 600);
    }

    document.getElementById('chatSendBtn').addEventListener('click', sendChat);
    chatInput.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Enter') sendChat(); });

    var fqOverlay = document.getElementById('faqModal');
    document.getElementById('faqModalClose').addEventListener('click', function(){ closeModal(fqOverlay); });
    fqOverlay.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target===fqOverlay) closeModal(fqOverlay); });
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-faq]').forEach(function(el){
      el.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); openModal(fqOverlay); });
    });
    fqOverlay.querySelectorAll('.faq-q').forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        var item = btn.parentElement;
        var wasOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
        fqOverlay.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(function(i){ i.classList.remove('open'); });
        if(!wasOpen) item.classList.add('open');
      });
    });

  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){
    if(e.key !== 'Escape') return;
    var pO = document.getElementById('policyModal');
    var cO = document.getElementById('contactModal');
    var fO = document.getElementById('faqModal');
    if(pO && pO.classList.contains('active')) closeModal(pO);
    if(cO && cO.classList.contains('active')){ closeModal(cO); resetContact(); }
    if(fO && fO.classList.contains('active')) closeModal(fO);
  });

  document.addEventListener('click', function(e){
    var el = e.target.closest('a[href*="/pages/contact"], a[href="/contact"]');
    if(el){
      e.preventDefault();
      var cO = document.getElementById('contactModal');
      if(cO){ resetContact(); openModal(cO); }
    }
  }, true);

  function injectChips(){
    var bar = document.querySelector('.utility-bar .page-width');
    if(!bar || document.getElementById('pgmChips')) return;
    var c = document.createElement('div');
    c.id = 'pgmChips'; c.className = 'pgm-chips';
    c.innerHTML = '<button class="pgm-chip pgm-chip-faq" data-faq="true">&#x2753; FAQ</button>'
                + '<button class="pgm-chip pgm-chip-ct" data-contact="true">&#x2709; Contact</button>';
    bar.appendChild(c);
  }
  if(document.readyState === 'loading'){
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', injectChips);
  } else { injectChips(); }
  setTimeout(injectChips, 500);

})();
</script>

